&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2024-02-06/170717974133624_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2024-02-06/170717974133624_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
     
    &lt;/dl&gt;
    &lt;br&gt;    
       
       </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2025-05-31/102326045.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">caixin:latest:https://database.caixin.com/2025-05-31/102326045.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 May 2025 02:00:09 GMT</pubDate><category>财新数据通频道</category></item><item><title>【市场动态】美国消费支出增长放缓 商品进口创纪录最大降幅</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;美国消费者在4月踩下刹车键，商品进口创下纪录最大降幅，因企业调整以应对更高的关税&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;   
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cms.caixin.com/g3/var/thumbs/_normal/2023-07-29/169060007693954.jpg&quot;&gt;
&lt;em style=&quot;
    position: absolute;
